v5/workbench/workbench.db*

# ===== 审计/产物大文件（不进 git，避免仓库膨胀；磁盘文件保留，仅停止跟踪）=====
v5/audit/*.parquet
v5/audit/*.csv
v5/audit/v6_enriched_lora/
v5/reports/suggestion-*.md

# ===== 个人自用:.codebuddy 共享子树放开(skills/agents/rules);memory/、automations/ 等本地私密保持忽略 =====
# 否定须位于 .codebuddy/ 之后;按 gitignore 规则:父目录被忽略时,须先反忽略父目录,才能对其子目录做选择性反忽略
!.codebuddy/
!.codebuddy/skills/
!.codebuddy/skills/**
!.codebuddy/agents/
!.codebuddy/agents/**
!.codebuddy/rules/
!.codebuddy/rules/**
# 重新忽略本地私密子树,防止泄露
.codebuddy/memory/
.codebuddy/automations/
